World English Bible

The World English Bible is in the Public Domain. That means that it is not
copyrighted. However, "World English Bible" is a trademark of eBible.org.
If you change the actual text of the World English Bible in any way, do not
call the result the World English Bible.

Source: https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp and https://worldenglish.bible
The publisher's notice as distributed by eBible.org is in copr.htm.
